  • Reconstruct and bijectively compare the Stage 1 local rule inventory
  • Independently reclassify rules against frozen source and operational semantics
  • Rerun trusted Stage 4 preflight and audit obligation/target identity
  • In proof mode, clean-build a fresh project and audit target, axioms, and operational bridges
  • Write evidence-backed REVIEW.md with the required final verdict pair
