codex
I found the concrete cause: inside this managed sandbox, `getpid()` returns a namespace PID (for example `2`) that has no corresponding `/proc/2/exe`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its installation by reading `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`. I’m applying a narrow audit-local compatibility shim that redirects only that exact executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; its source and hash will be evidence, and the trusted preflight logic itself remains unchanged.
